A cat program in boolf*ck via direct translation from brainf*ck

There is a 5 instruction brainf*ck cat program that assumes EOF gives zero
Translate each instruction directly into boolf*ck and you get this

comma
>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,<<<<<<<<

open bracket
>>>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<+[>+]<[<]>>>>>>>>>[+<<<<<<<<[>]+<[+<]

period
>;>;>;>;>;>;>;>;<<<<<<<<

comma
>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,<<<<<<<<

close bracket
>>>>>>>>>+<<<<<<<<+[>+]<[<]>>>>>>>>>]<[+<]
